luci-theme-noobwrt21 - "NoobWRT (21.02 port)"

Port of luci-theme-noobwrt 1.1.7 by nooblk-98,
https://github.com/nooblk-98/luci-theme-noobwrt (Apache-2.0), itself derived from
luci-theme-argon by jerrykuku (Apache-2.0) and luci-theme-material by Lutty Yang.
Stylesheets, menu script, toolbar, icons, icon font and the NoobWRT logos are NoobWRT's.
Red Hat Display: Copyright 2024 The Red Hat Project Authors (https://github.com/RedHatOfficial/RedHatFont),
SIL Open Font License 1.1 (www/luci-static/noobwrt21/fonts/OFL.txt).

Port changes (2026, Dror Dvash): ucode templates rewritten as OpenWrt 21.02 Lua
templates; /etc/config/noobwrt, the settings page and the online wallpaper fetcher
(rpcd backend) removed; the login picture removed (unknown origin; a CSS gradient
instead); TypoGraphica font (all rights reserved) and Google Sans references replaced
by Red Hat Display; italic face, video backgrounds, PWA manifest and the timed dark mode
removed; toolbar shows a fixed set of 21.02 pages that exist on the router; dark.css
linked instead of inlined; images downscaled; reduced-motion support, 21.02 widget
fixes, phone fix for "-- custom --" dropdown entries; a row of stat cards on
Status > Overview drawn after NoobWRT's screenshots (written for the port).
